        <section className="feature-section shell-wide" id="platform"><div className="section-intro"><div><div className="eyebrow">Signal over noise</div><h2>Everything your solar portfolio needs to perform.</h2></div><p>SolarOne turns fragmented inverter portals into one calm, actionable operating picture.</p></div><div className="feature-grid"><FeatureCard icon={<Gauge />} title="See the full picture" copy="Production, consumption, batteries, grid flow, and system health in one live view." large /><FeatureCard icon={<ShieldCheck />} title="Know what needs attention" copy="Clear alerts and health signals help your team move before a small issue becomes downtime." /><FeatureCard icon={<Globe2 />} title="Connect your ecosystem" copy="A provider architecture built to add new manufacturers without rewriting the product." /></div></section>
